{"client_side":"required","server_side":"required","game_versions":["1.19.4","1.20.1","1.20.4","1.20.6","1.21","1.21.1","1.21.3","1.21.4"],"environment":["client_and_server"],"id":"A3Pyh525","slug":"beundead","project_type":"mod","team":"6BI36kVY","organization":null,"title":"Be Undead","description":"If you die, you are a zombie.","body":"# If you die, you will turn into a zombie.\n\nBeing a zombie has many disadvantages, but don't worry, you can be turned back by using a weakness potion and a golden apple.\n\nI challenge you to play through the game while being a zombie.\n\n![You can play in your modified skin as a Zombie](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/adc57b039e690a924c90a414b8d2bbeffbec3f39.png)\n![It has gameplay implications](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/912f4afe5ef8b3e3bec2e57cc33642a45dc8c9c5.png)\n\n\n## Features\n\nYou can play as:\n-Zombie\n-Drowned (when you die under water)\n-Husk (when you die on sand)\n\nZombies only have one inventory slot with the armor and offhand slots, but you can right-click a chest to get access to the rest of the hotbar. (This can be modified in the config)\n\nThey can only gain experience through killing.\nIf not wearing a helmet or being a husk, zombies will burn in sunlight.\nDrowns can swim and breath under water.\nFor zombies, healing/harming potions are inverted and the smite enchantment does additional damage.","body_url":null,"published":"2025-04-10T19:40:26.878601Z","updated":"2026-01-10T10:55:54.633254Z","approved":"2025-04-15T20:41:32.874529Z","queued":"2025-04-10T19:50:26.814441Z","status":"approved","requested_status":"approved","moderator_message":null,"license":{"id":"LicenseRef-All-Rights-Reserved","name":"","url":null},"downloads":2963,"followers":17,"categories":["game-mechanics"],"additional_categories":["adventure","mobs"],"loaders":["fabric","forge","neoforge"],"versions":["uI0fNrn4","yhdH633v","DETAaqr4","HSttC8CF","j2rJG6Vz","q0tk6g8l","N3vBmklp","hVbkRnxU","VnktQK6o","QS8Vif